<title>JAPAN: S'tomo Bank says considering listing on NYSE.</title>
<headline>S'tomo Bank says considering listing on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Bank Ltd is considering listing its shares on the New York Stock Exchange, a bank official told reporters on Friday.</p>
</text>
